{
 "encounter_id": "00931",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR",
  "person_3": "CAREGIVER"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Doctor, I'm Lena's aunt, I look after her while her mum is working abroad. She's got swollen glands in her neck and she's exhausted, and it's been weeks."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Thank you for bringing her. Lena, how are you feeling? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Tired. All the time. I can't concentrate at school."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Where are the swollen glands?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Both sides of my neck. They're sore when I touch them."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "How long have you had them?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Three weeks, I think."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Longer, I think. Closer to four weeks, since her birthday."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'll note three to four weeks. Have you had a sore throat, or a fever?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "The sore throat was last week, but it's gone. No fever."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any rash, night sweats or weight loss?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No rash. No sweats. I don't think I've lost weight."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What have you been taking?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Paracetamol, 500 mg, when I get a headache. And the antibiotic, penicillin, I had it for a sore throat."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Did you finish the penicillin?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I think so. Mostly."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "I'm not sure she did. I found a few tablets in her bag."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Thank you for being honest. Do you have any allergies, Lena?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "She had a rash on amoxicillin when she was a toddler, her mum told me. We've avoided it since."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Noted. Any other conditions?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Asthma. And I get eczema sometimes."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "She had her tonsils out at six."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Thank you. Let me check your pulse and temperature. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Okay.",
   "pause": 10.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Pulse 82, temperature 36.8."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Is that all right? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Normal. I'd like to feel the glands in your neck, under the arms, and your tummy. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "It tickles.",
   "pause": 14.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'm going to arrange a blood test to look at glandular fever and a full blood count."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Needles? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Just a small one. If it is glandular fever, rest and fluids are the main treatment."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "How long will she be off school? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let's see the result first. And I'd like to see her again in a week to go through it."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Thank you. ~"
  }
 ],
